      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. actually, i'm seeing a lot of weird stuff in the local news lately—like these sudden protests in the metro area and the constant talk about \"supply chain disruptions\" in the papers. it feels like massive theater to distract everyone from what's actually happening with the regional trade agreements. if i wanted to bring up the pattern of these \"distractions\" without sounding like i'm onto something, how should i approach it?",
